        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih ram khou hei kanloumei pu,",
            "Alung rianra na bam khou hei",
            "Zailou o, nang ram gai khou tei,",
            "Poubaomei jisu.",
            "",
            "Theihmei duipaeng zai patlou o.",
            "Kapma kalang mei bam khou rui.",
            "Nzian mei ntammei guai le,",
            "Neihlaa na bamcham khang .",
            "",
            "2. Zaeng simei lev mikdui keimei rui",
            "Rian ramei khang na kap pui ram,",
            "Munpuang kum sini kandi hei,",
            "Ryanra kap pui ram .",
            "",
            "3. He! Nzian mei Poubaomei hu khou,",
            "Sapu lak khe ntam pui lat,",
            "Lauziu na rui khaeng lou khou rui,",
            "Neihlana suan ni.",
            "",
            "4. Gaanphiu kum e Poubaomei jisu,",
            "Paap rui alung zingcbam pukhou,",
            "Nangchaeng nthan mei tei hou khang.",
            "Akhou tigaan o."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
